e her childhood.\n\nOne day at school, Tanpopo is called upon by the special anti-phantom organization Butterfly responsible for managing magical girls. They believe Tanpopo has a great potential to become a powerful magical girl herself, but Shade warns her that should she become one, they will become enemies. All Tanpopo ever wanted was to fight alongside her most trusted friend—but when she inadvertently awakens her powers, she realizes that the truth behind both phantoms and magical girls is a far cry from the reality she once knew.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","cover":"/api/proxy/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.readdetectiveconan.com%2Ffile%2Fmangapill%2Fi%2F8453.jpeg","image":"/api/proxy/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.readdetectiveconan.com%2Ffile%2Fmangapill%2Fi%2F8453.jpeg"},"type":"manga","format":"Manga & Manhwa","source":"Mangapill"}